Thanks for signing up, [FIRST_NAME]

Your [PRODUCT_NAME] account is ready to use. We are glad you are
here.

The fastest way to get value out of [PRODUCT_NAME] is to finish
setting up your workspace. It takes about two minutes, and you only
have to do it once.

Finish setting up:

[CTA_URL]

Something not working, or a question we have not answered? Reply to
this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every
message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
